WEBVTT

01:13.700 --> 01:16.860
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.620 --> 01:21.860
[Episode 37]

01:33.535 --> 01:35.454
Just have a look.

01:35.455 --> 01:36.774
Make no noise.

01:36.775 --> 01:39.014
Don't let Xie Qiang find us.

01:39.015 --> 01:41.534
What if he notices us?

01:41.535 --> 01:42.814
No such possibility.

01:42.815 --> 01:44.654
If he finds us, we'll be hapless.

01:44.655 --> 01:46.054
Who told you?

01:46.055 --> 01:48.094
Zhang Xuefeng and other people said.

01:48.095 --> 01:50.414
Don't listen to his nonsense.

01:50.415 --> 01:54.054
My granny tells me Xie Qiang
only dislikes naughty kids.

01:54.055 --> 01:56.694
I fear to see him.

01:56.695 --> 01:58.134
We're machos.

01:58.135 --> 02:01.294
As we're here now,
shall we flinch?

02:01.295 --> 02:03.054
I agree with him.

02:03.055 --> 02:04.894
Hulu, do you fear?

02:04.895 --> 02:06.294
Of course not.

02:06.295 --> 02:07.814
I'm female.

02:07.815 --> 02:10.535
Mom always says females need to be robust.

02:11.295 --> 02:12.655
Don't be afraid. Just follow me.

02:27.735 --> 02:29.214
Who is Xie Qiang?

02:29.215 --> 02:31.375
The tallest, strongest, and most powerful.

02:35.175 --> 02:35.855
Qiang comes back.

02:36.415 --> 02:37.894
He'll drink a toast to you.

02:37.895 --> 02:39.094
I find my dad.

02:39.095 --> 02:41.295
Sister Hongdou and Uncle Yao.

02:43.455 --> 02:45.294
He should sit at the table next to them.

02:45.295 --> 02:46.975
Full of men.

02:51.095 --> 02:51.735
Qiang.

02:53.175 --> 02:55.815
You have to treat your
parents with filial respect.

02:56.335 --> 02:57.775
Don't let them down again.

02:58.295 --> 03:02.655
Do you know how they lived during these years?

03:03.888 --> 03:06.254
They've grudged to eat and use anything,

03:06.255 --> 03:07.615
only knew to make money.

03:08.975 --> 03:10.095
Do you know that?

03:10.855 --> 03:13.055
He's sent to the hospital because of anemia.

03:13.975 --> 03:15.374
Forget it.

03:15.375 --> 03:17.495
Everyone may fall ill, right?

03:18.735 --> 03:19.574
Qiang.

03:19.575 --> 03:21.575
Drink a toast to them!

03:22.895 --> 03:24.095
I haven't finished yet.

03:24.975 --> 03:25.695
Qiang.

03:26.415 --> 03:29.214
You've remoulded yourself in the jail for years.

03:29.215 --> 03:33.175
Your uncles believe you become good now.

03:33.775 --> 03:36.735
We hope you could be a good man.

03:37.255 --> 03:39.614
Everyone could make a mistake.

03:39.615 --> 03:40.935
It will be fine for you to correct it.

03:43.135 --> 03:46.254
We only fear that you
can't control yourself

03:46.255 --> 03:47.655
and become a stealing addict.

03:53.895 --> 03:54.815
I'll be back soon.

03:57.695 --> 03:58.855
Come on, uncle.

03:59.455 --> 04:00.814
Qiang has drunk too much.

04:00.815 --> 04:02.254
I'll drink it for him.

04:02.255 --> 04:03.135
You?

04:04.135 --> 04:05.494
We grow up together.

04:05.495 --> 04:07.694
Auntie Feng has cooked me
a lot of delicious food since I was little.

04:07.695 --> 04:08.735
So am I qualified?

04:09.855 --> 04:11.014
Yes...

04:11.015 --> 04:12.694
Come on.

04:12.695 --> 04:13.175
Cheers.

04:21.995 --> 04:22.655
Come on.

04:23.215 --> 04:25.775
Let me pour the drink for you.

04:26.735 --> 04:27.975
Here you are.

04:28.655 --> 04:29.535
Thank you.

04:31.535 --> 04:35.095
The youngster was childish
and took a wrong path

04:35.975 --> 04:37.175
but he's remoulded himself.

04:37.935 --> 04:40.175
Who can promise to
make no mistakes in one's whole life?

04:41.175 --> 04:42.254
An old saying goes well,

04:42.255 --> 04:44.294
"a prodigal who returns
is more precious than gold".

04:44.295 --> 04:46.254
Just let the past go.

04:46.255 --> 04:47.494
Don't mention it again.

04:47.495 --> 04:48.735
It can help change nothing.

04:49.615 --> 04:52.055
We could know your words are for his good

04:52.895 --> 04:54.814
but strangers could not know that.

04:54.815 --> 04:56.774
They might think you're gossiping.

04:56.775 --> 04:58.574
We can't let them laugh at us, right?

04:58.575 --> 04:59.374
That's it.

04:59.375 --> 05:00.994
We said it all out of kindness.

05:00.995 --> 05:01.734
Yes.

05:01.735 --> 05:02.894
We won't mention it again.

05:02.895 --> 05:04.214
Okay. Forget it.

05:04.215 --> 05:04.894
Really?

05:04.895 --> 05:05.294
Yes.

05:05.295 --> 05:06.454
Great. Thank you so much.

05:06.455 --> 05:08.214
To such a happy day!

05:08.215 --> 05:08.934
Fine. Cheers!

05:08.935 --> 05:09.814
Cheers!

05:09.815 --> 05:11.134
Thank you so much.

05:11.135 --> 05:11.814
Come on!

05:11.815 --> 05:13.894
He stands up! I see him!

05:13.895 --> 05:15.694
It must be him!

05:15.695 --> 05:16.854
He's Xie Qiang!

05:16.855 --> 05:18.335
He's really tall and strong.

05:18.935 --> 05:19.655
Come on.

05:20.295 --> 05:21.094
Help yourselves.

05:21.095 --> 05:21.855
Enjoy it.

05:22.655 --> 05:23.894
Hulu.

05:23.895 --> 05:26.094
Have you had lunch?

05:26.095 --> 05:26.854
Oh, no!

05:26.855 --> 05:27.575
Run!

05:28.975 --> 05:29.535
Why?

05:30.295 --> 05:30.854
Ignore them.

05:30.855 --> 05:31.575
They're playing.

05:32.415 --> 05:33.175
Let's continue.

05:34.095 --> 05:35.455
Run!

05:37.655 --> 05:39.175
- I can't drink fast.
- Take your time.

05:40.175 --> 05:41.015
Drink less.

05:44.455 --> 05:45.814
How can he expose us?

05:45.815 --> 05:47.695
Bad uncle!

05:51.055 --> 05:51.935
You guys! Hulu!

05:53.055 --> 05:54.814
Come back to eat!

05:54.815 --> 05:55.455
Stop there!

05:56.855 --> 05:59.255
Their relatives are really good at drinking.

06:03.735 --> 06:04.135
Hongdou!

06:05.055 --> 06:05.695
Wait for a second!

06:06.855 --> 06:07.375
Here you are.

06:07.975 --> 06:09.175
Not leftovers.

06:09.975 --> 06:11.574
It's for granny.

06:11.575 --> 06:12.335
Thank you.

06:13.535 --> 06:13.855
Damai.

06:14.455 --> 06:16.294
I find you like beef.

06:16.295 --> 06:17.775
Take it back and eat with Nana.

06:18.535 --> 06:19.215
Thank you so much.

06:20.215 --> 06:21.935
I should thank you.

06:22.615 --> 06:24.015
You've helped us a lot!

06:26.095 --> 06:26.775
Is he fine?

06:27.775 --> 06:29.454
We'll make some soup to help him sober up.

06:29.455 --> 06:31.294
We won't take up any more of your time.

06:31.295 --> 06:32.255
He's drunk a lot.

06:33.695 --> 06:34.614
We have to go now.

06:34.615 --> 06:35.335
See you.

06:36.095 --> 06:36.694
Take care.

06:36.695 --> 06:37.814
Okay. Let me take it.

06:37.815 --> 06:38.775
Make him some tea.

06:44.375 --> 06:45.014
Fine.

06:45.015 --> 06:47.575
Don't forget to hire me next time!

06:48.215 --> 06:50.254
I promise we will.

06:50.255 --> 06:51.614
You cook so well!

06:51.615 --> 06:52.215
Thank you.

06:53.095 --> 06:54.734
Let me see him off.

06:54.735 --> 06:56.134
You're too polite.

06:56.135 --> 06:56.935
It's fine.

07:00.135 --> 07:01.415
Take care! Thank you!

07:30.975 --> 07:31.495
Mom.

07:33.575 --> 07:34.175
My son!

07:40.615 --> 07:41.215
Mom.

07:42.135 --> 07:42.815
Have a sit.

07:51.055 --> 07:52.015
Mom, don't cry.

07:53.175 --> 07:53.935
I'm back.

07:56.775 --> 07:57.655
My son!

07:59.215 --> 08:00.455
I'm sorry for you, mom.

08:01.935 --> 08:04.534
Mom, don't cry!

08:04.535 --> 08:06.594
♫ Cuttlefish smells fresh ♫

08:06.595 --> 08:09.114
♫ Then what to do now ♫

08:09.115 --> 08:12.695
♫ It's time to air mung beans ♫

08:17.595 --> 08:20.354
♫ Mung bean smells good ♫

08:20.355 --> 08:23.274
♫ It's time to air young ginger ♫

08:23.275 --> 08:25.874
♫ Ginger smells pungent ♫

08:25.875 --> 08:28.415
♫ It's time to air Chinese artichoke ♫

08:28.935 --> 08:31.714
♫ Just like little pagodas ♫

08:31.715 --> 08:34.554
♫ Tier so high ♫

08:34.555 --> 08:38.135
♫ Time for my baby falling asleep ♫

08:43.115 --> 08:45.874
♫ Just like little pagodas ♫

08:45.875 --> 08:48.694
♫ Tier so high ♫

08:48.695 --> 08:52.695
♫ Time for my baby falling asleep ♫

09:35.135 --> 09:35.815
Are you sober?

09:36.375 --> 09:36.975
Thirsty or not?

09:43.255 --> 09:44.095
Let me see.

09:45.375 --> 09:46.895
Your face is still hot.

09:47.655 --> 09:49.134
You're so marvelous.

09:49.135 --> 09:50.815
No one can drink more than you, right?

09:51.535 --> 09:52.695
Don't you feel uncomfortable?

09:53.695 --> 09:54.694
It's fine.

09:54.695 --> 09:56.175
Just a little woozy.

09:57.535 --> 09:58.175
Where's granny?

09:59.375 --> 10:00.535
I've asked her to sleep.

10:01.215 --> 10:02.695
Your dinner is in the pot.

10:24.175 --> 10:27.375
Sorry for letting you look after a drunkard.

10:29.015 --> 10:29.935
It's fine.

10:30.735 --> 10:32.254
Not that horrible.

10:32.255 --> 10:34.054
You're sleepy when you're drunk.

10:34.055 --> 10:35.895
No vomit, no trouble.

10:36.895 --> 10:38.255
But I still need to tell you that

10:39.175 --> 10:40.655
you're not a youngster

10:41.415 --> 10:42.855
so don't drink too much.

10:43.375 --> 10:45.614
You can't drink so much like this.

10:45.615 --> 10:46.815
It will harm your health.

10:47.375 --> 10:48.975
Not a youngster?

10:49.775 --> 10:51.495
I'm in my prime, okay?

10:52.375 --> 10:53.774
After you drank a little,

10:53.775 --> 10:55.734
your face became tumid just like a steamed bun.

10:55.735 --> 10:56.775
Really a youngster?

11:00.575 --> 11:01.175
Am I right?

11:06.955 --> 11:07.735
Tired?

11:10.695 --> 11:11.575
What are you doing?

11:12.215 --> 11:13.374
Accounts.

11:13.375 --> 11:14.815
Everything needs money.

11:15.775 --> 11:18.054
Recently, I've gotten what is called

11:18.055 --> 11:20.094
"spend money like water".

11:20.095 --> 11:21.495
Sounds like rustling.

11:22.775 --> 11:26.094
If you could do it well,
it could be like a windfall

11:26.095 --> 11:28.494
also with a rustling sound.

11:28.495 --> 11:29.814
Hope you're right.

11:29.815 --> 11:30.775
Hope so.

11:32.495 --> 11:33.974
Thanks for taking care of me.

11:33.975 --> 11:36.094
Time to repay.

11:36.095 --> 11:37.975
Let me massage for you.

11:39.215 --> 11:40.095
Aren't you tired?

11:41.415 --> 11:42.094
No.

11:42.095 --> 11:43.134
Lean on it.

11:43.135 --> 11:44.494
You should have a rest.

11:44.495 --> 11:45.135
I'm fine.

11:45.735 --> 11:46.255
Come on.

11:55.295 --> 11:56.175
Comfortable?

11:58.535 --> 12:01.175
Don't make yourself so tired.

12:01.935 --> 12:04.015
Tell me if you need my help.

12:07.615 --> 12:08.415
Yao.

12:09.015 --> 12:09.735
Do you know

12:10.455 --> 12:12.095
the difference between fatigues?

12:13.855 --> 12:14.815
They're not the same.

12:15.655 --> 12:17.374
There is a kind of fatigue

12:17.375 --> 12:19.734
which is like staying in an endless desert.

12:19.735 --> 12:20.654
You know?

12:20.655 --> 12:23.415
And another fatigue is
like crossing mountains.

12:24.415 --> 12:25.895
But there is so much fun there.

12:27.375 --> 12:28.634
So can you feel the fun now?

12:28.635 --> 12:32.354
♫ I will be yours ♫

12:32.355 --> 12:35.574
♫ Would you ask for any horse ♫

12:35.575 --> 12:39.455
♫ but this one inside your heart ♫

12:40.275 --> 12:42.215
♫ I'll give you... ♫

12:58.135 --> 12:59.375
Jun!

12:59.935 --> 13:01.154
Where did you go?

13:01.155 --> 13:02.814
I went to the farm and picked some vegetables.

13:02.815 --> 13:03.854
Go to change your clothes.

13:03.855 --> 13:04.974
Let me bring you out.

13:04.975 --> 13:05.974
Where?

13:05.975 --> 13:07.134
Watch the show.

13:07.135 --> 13:07.695
Go!

13:10.935 --> 13:13.174
You must come with them.

13:13.175 --> 13:15.894
Do you want me to chat with your parents alone?

13:15.895 --> 13:17.014
Yanran's mom comes.

13:17.015 --> 13:18.374
Please get on the bus.

13:18.375 --> 13:19.214
Sell water purifiers?

13:19.215 --> 13:20.815
Is it the time to do so?

13:21.375 --> 13:23.895
I'll help you sell out 10 sets, okay?

13:25.815 --> 13:26.654
Okay. Fine.

13:26.655 --> 13:27.455
See you.

13:33.615 --> 13:35.615
We didn't quarrel.

13:38.135 --> 13:38.975
What's going on?

13:39.535 --> 13:40.934
We're going to perform today.

13:40.935 --> 13:42.094
Be happy.

13:42.095 --> 13:43.054
Right?

13:43.055 --> 13:43.735
Hulu's mom.

13:44.375 --> 13:45.214
Time to leave.

13:45.215 --> 13:45.735
I see.

13:47.495 --> 13:47.935
Take care.

13:51.415 --> 13:52.614
We didn't quarrel.

13:52.615 --> 13:53.575
Okay?

13:54.135 --> 13:54.534
Ms. Zhang.

13:54.535 --> 13:55.414
Mr. Hu comes.

13:55.415 --> 13:56.974
Any other seats here?

13:56.975 --> 13:57.574
Yes.

13:57.575 --> 13:58.095
Fine.

13:58.935 --> 13:59.335
By the way.

14:00.375 --> 14:01.294
She's my friend.

14:01.295 --> 14:02.375
Help me record the show.

14:03.095 --> 14:03.894
Hello.

14:03.895 --> 14:04.694
Hello.

14:04.695 --> 14:05.734
Then hop in.

14:05.735 --> 14:07.055
Fine. We'll go with you.

14:07.615 --> 14:08.535
Come on.

14:09.755 --> 14:10.214
Mr. Hu.

14:10.215 --> 14:10.894
Mr. Hu.

14:10.895 --> 14:12.694
Mr. Hu! Sit with me!

14:12.695 --> 14:14.014
Sit with you?

14:14.015 --> 14:15.374
Where are your parents?

14:15.375 --> 14:17.134
They're out.

14:17.135 --> 14:18.775
And my grandparents can't come.

14:20.975 --> 14:21.975
Just sit here.

14:23.375 --> 14:24.255
Come on.

14:24.775 --> 14:25.895
Manjun, come here!

14:28.015 --> 14:29.094
I'll sit with Xiaochun.

14:29.095 --> 14:29.734
Have your seat.

14:29.735 --> 14:30.375
Fine, I see.

14:31.175 --> 14:32.015
Sit with them.

14:32.635 --> 14:33.135
Come on.

14:33.935 --> 14:34.814
Sit with you.

14:34.815 --> 14:35.894
Hulu.

14:35.895 --> 14:37.094
Who is she?

14:37.095 --> 14:37.814
Auntie.

14:37.815 --> 14:38.935
That's it.

14:40.295 --> 14:42.014
Have you fastened your seat belts?

14:42.015 --> 14:44.774
Yes!

14:44.775 --> 14:46.494
Fine. Then let's go.

14:46.495 --> 14:47.614
Have you?

14:47.615 --> 14:48.494
Yes.

14:48.495 --> 14:49.455
Sir, close the door.

15:00.615 --> 15:01.334
Let's go.

15:01.335 --> 15:02.654
Beware of the steps.

15:02.655 --> 15:04.015
Slow down.

15:05.055 --> 15:05.695
Let me show you.

15:06.215 --> 15:07.054
Press here.

15:07.055 --> 15:08.774
It will power on.

15:08.775 --> 15:09.414
Now it's on.

15:09.415 --> 15:10.895
Press here to record.

15:11.455 --> 15:12.814
You see it works.

15:12.815 --> 15:14.055
It's auto-focus.

15:14.655 --> 15:15.214
I see.

15:15.215 --> 15:15.695
Let me try.

15:21.135 --> 15:21.975
Hulu.

15:22.735 --> 15:23.375
Hulu.

15:23.975 --> 15:25.054
Hello.

15:25.055 --> 15:26.095
Hi.

15:37.415 --> 15:38.175
Let me help you.

15:57.215 --> 15:57.695
Fine.

16:02.495 --> 16:02.935
Not bad.

16:03.535 --> 16:04.335
I'll take my seat.

16:09.815 --> 16:10.495
Mr. Hu.

16:11.295 --> 16:12.654
Good friend?

16:12.655 --> 16:13.935
I think she's your girlfriend.

16:20.575 --> 16:23.454
♫ Full moon in the sky. ♫

16:23.455 --> 16:26.254
♫ Shadows on the ground. ♫

16:26.255 --> 16:30.095
♫ Staying in pairs with each other. ♫

16:31.601 --> 16:34.134
♫ Soft wind. Tender clouds. ♫

16:34.135 --> 16:36.854
♫ There's a line in the sky. ♫

16:36.855 --> 16:41.095
♫ A plane leaves it there. ♫

16:45.575 --> 16:48.454
Next program is the chorus of "Motherland,
I love you"

16:48.455 --> 16:49.774
performed by

16:49.775 --> 16:51.854
Class Seedling of
Seeding from Clouds Kindergarten.

16:51.855 --> 16:52.455
Welcome them.

16:53.255 --> 16:55.055
It's Hulu's turn!

17:16.815 --> 17:21.294
♫ Little crayons wear colored clothes. ♫

17:21.295 --> 17:24.775
♫ How beautiful they look! ♫

17:25.855 --> 17:30.214
♫ Little kids here look so happy. ♫

17:30.215 --> 17:33.775
♫ Let's have a drawing competition. ♫

17:34.695 --> 17:39.374
♫ Draw some birds flying in the sky. ♫

17:39.375 --> 17:43.814
♫ Draw some grasses growing up in the spring. ♫

17:43.815 --> 17:46.054
♫ You draw a sun ♫

17:46.055 --> 17:48.374
♫ and I paint a national flag. ♫

17:48.375 --> 17:50.574
♫ Motherland China! ♫

17:50.575 --> 17:52.774
♫ We love you! ♫

17:52.775 --> 17:55.054
♫ Motherland China! ♫

17:55.055 --> 17:57.015
♫ We love you! ♫

18:05.855 --> 18:07.174
Can't today.

18:07.175 --> 18:09.254
My daughter performed on the stage here.

18:09.255 --> 18:10.015
What about tomorrow?

18:11.535 --> 18:11.774
Fine.

18:11.775 --> 18:13.154
Nine o'clock tomorrow.

18:13.155 --> 18:13.775
Is that okay?

18:14.815 --> 18:16.214
Fine. It's deal.

18:16.215 --> 18:16.975
See you tomorrow.

18:17.775 --> 18:18.135
Bye.

18:23.175 --> 18:23.775
Xiaochun.

18:25.495 --> 18:25.975
Mr. Hu.

18:27.975 --> 18:29.455
I need to tell you something.

18:30.615 --> 18:33.415
Don't think I'm meddlesome
and then blame me.

18:34.375 --> 18:37.574
I find that Hulu's grandparents both came.

18:37.575 --> 18:39.335
So I think I have to tell you that.

18:40.135 --> 18:41.775
Just go ahead.

18:44.135 --> 18:46.735
It's about Hulu's education.

18:49.015 --> 18:50.094
Though I know little about education

18:50.095 --> 18:53.694
and I'm not a real teacher,
I still think I should tell you.

18:53.695 --> 18:55.134
Otherwise, I'll feel so bad.

18:55.135 --> 18:56.294
That's why I must tell you.

18:56.295 --> 18:58.174
Could you please stop the nonsense?

18:58.175 --> 18:58.815
Just go ahead.

19:03.735 --> 19:04.655
Have you found

19:05.575 --> 19:07.375
Hulu is unhappy today?

19:08.495 --> 19:10.634
Yes. Because she didn't stand in the middle.

19:10.635 --> 19:12.374
Kids want to show themselves. I know it.

19:12.375 --> 19:13.335
See!

19:13.855 --> 19:15.215
It's the typical logic of adults.

19:16.055 --> 19:17.415
What's Hulu's logic?

19:18.215 --> 19:20.534
She thinks the middle is the best.

19:20.535 --> 19:23.654
If she can't be the best,
her grandparents will say

19:23.655 --> 19:26.215
the school here and
your education is poor.

19:26.775 --> 19:28.255
Then she couldn't learn here anymore.

19:29.775 --> 19:32.895
She doesn't want to prevail over others.

19:33.855 --> 19:35.375
She just fears leaving you.

19:53.615 --> 19:55.335
Hulu. Have some vegetables.

19:56.135 --> 19:57.454
Balance the nutrition.

19:57.455 --> 19:58.894
Thank you, grandpa.

19:58.895 --> 19:59.415
Good girl.

20:03.135 --> 20:05.374
Who says Hulu is a fussy eater?

20:05.375 --> 20:06.775
Not at all.

20:07.455 --> 20:08.374
Grandma.

20:08.375 --> 20:10.814
My mom makes yummy food for me every day.

20:10.815 --> 20:13.734
She also reads stories
and teaches me to read.

20:13.735 --> 20:14.255
Really?

20:14.855 --> 20:16.414
How many words do you know?

20:16.415 --> 20:17.615
So many!

20:18.135 --> 20:20.454
The reason why I didn't stand in the middle

20:20.455 --> 20:22.495
is that I'm too high.

20:23.535 --> 20:25.754
It's quite abrupt for the tall
to stand in the middle.

20:25.755 --> 20:26.295
That's it!

20:27.015 --> 20:28.454
When you study in Kunming,

20:28.455 --> 20:30.654
grandma will make delicious food too.

20:30.655 --> 20:31.935
And I'll read stories for you.

20:36.695 --> 20:37.135
Father.

20:38.575 --> 20:40.374
I could agree with you about other things

20:40.375 --> 20:42.214
except for Hulu's education.

20:42.215 --> 20:43.455
We should discuss it again.

20:44.015 --> 20:45.694
I'm afraid I can't agree with you.

20:45.695 --> 20:47.415
She must study in Kunming.

20:48.135 --> 20:50.254
We can't delay her education.

20:50.255 --> 20:51.455
I can't listen to you.

20:53.055 --> 20:54.015
I've planned to

20:55.575 --> 20:57.654
let her study at the primary school here

20:57.655 --> 20:59.814
and go back to Kunming
for junior high school.

20:59.815 --> 21:01.215
Then how can she compete with others?

21:01.815 --> 21:03.575
They'll win at the starting line!

21:05.095 --> 21:07.095
If you mention the starting line,

21:07.615 --> 21:08.335
I think

21:09.415 --> 21:11.055
parents are the starting lines of kids.

21:12.415 --> 21:15.614
After graduation,
I own a small business

21:15.615 --> 21:17.174
and Luo Quan sells water purifiers.

21:17.175 --> 21:19.415
We could only provide her with limited materials

21:20.255 --> 21:24.534
so we think the best
thing that we could give her

21:24.535 --> 21:27.414
should be a happy childhood
and an unconstrained future.

21:27.415 --> 21:28.495
What are you talking about?

21:29.615 --> 21:30.655
Unconstrained?

21:31.375 --> 21:32.734
Hulu is so smart.

21:32.735 --> 21:35.095
Obviously, she will surpass you
so much in the future.

21:36.455 --> 21:39.655
You're incapable so you don't
want to cultivate your child?

21:40.175 --> 21:41.335
I do cultivate her.

21:42.015 --> 21:43.694
I've already sent her to study at school.

21:43.695 --> 21:44.574
What else do you want?

21:44.575 --> 21:45.454
Bring her extra classes?

21:45.455 --> 21:47.454
To learn instruments and painting.

21:47.455 --> 21:48.574
To win a Math Olympiad prize?

21:48.575 --> 21:49.694
Then it's called "cultivation"?

21:49.695 --> 21:51.894
Everyone lets kids learn the art.

21:51.895 --> 21:53.414
She could learn it.

21:53.415 --> 21:55.254
There's an artistic atmosphere in our village.

21:55.255 --> 21:58.414
She could learn embroidery,
tire-dye and craving.

21:58.415 --> 22:00.094
Recently, two painters come.

22:00.095 --> 22:03.134
If she wants,
I could introduce her to learn with them.

22:03.135 --> 22:04.254
Lower your voice.

22:04.255 --> 22:05.494
We're outside.

22:05.495 --> 22:06.814
Don't influence others.

22:06.815 --> 22:07.335
She's right.

22:13.775 --> 22:14.255
Xiaochun.

22:14.895 --> 22:16.175
What did we discuss?

22:17.935 --> 22:18.695
I remember it.

22:19.415 --> 22:21.054
We did make a decision together.

22:21.055 --> 22:23.774
Anyhow, we should adjust to her change.

22:23.775 --> 22:26.455
I think she will be a waste
if she still lives with you!

22:29.135 --> 22:30.015
What do you mean by that?

22:30.695 --> 22:32.974
Now she has a good reading habit

22:32.975 --> 22:34.254
and a strong thirst for knowledge.

22:34.255 --> 22:37.895
She's brave, kind caring, loyal, and polite.

22:38.815 --> 22:40.495
Do you know her biggest dream?

22:43.375 --> 22:44.815
She wants to be an astronaut.

22:45.655 --> 22:47.055
Is it called "waste"?

22:50.615 --> 22:51.734
Don't quarrel outside.

22:51.735 --> 22:52.815
Are you really a dad?

22:58.815 --> 22:59.575
Useless.

23:00.135 --> 23:00.855
Fence-sitter.

23:02.135 --> 23:02.695
Stop eating.

23:03.775 --> 23:04.455
Let's go home.

23:05.575 --> 23:06.254
Enjoy the meal.

23:06.255 --> 23:07.175
Call me if necessary.

23:07.815 --> 23:09.174
Go. Carry your spoon.

23:09.175 --> 23:09.735
Spoon!

23:11.495 --> 23:12.135
Xiaochun.

23:15.615 --> 23:18.234
I've told you you can't win the quarrel.

23:18.235 --> 23:19.094
I didn't quarrel.

23:19.095 --> 23:20.055
I just brought out facts.

23:20.695 --> 23:21.534
Dad.

23:21.535 --> 23:22.854
Xiaochun also brought out the facts.

23:22.855 --> 23:23.495
Shut up!

23:24.775 --> 23:25.535
She's right.

23:26.375 --> 23:27.455
You're so useless.

23:27.975 --> 23:28.775
Just a fence-sitter.

23:38.135 --> 23:39.095
Mom, do you want some?

23:40.095 --> 23:41.295
No, thanks. Enjoy it yourself.

23:46.335 --> 23:46.935
Hulu.

23:47.815 --> 23:48.895
I want to ask you something.

23:49.855 --> 23:52.175
Do I look fierce?

23:53.495 --> 23:54.135
Really?

23:58.855 --> 24:00.855
What do you hope me to look like?

24:01.455 --> 24:02.655
Tell me. I'll change.

24:04.135 --> 24:05.975
I hope you could be happy.

24:08.255 --> 24:08.895
What else?

24:13.215 --> 24:14.374
Nothing else.

24:14.375 --> 24:17.135
You'll get full marks
if you become happy.

24:25.775 --> 24:27.855
Hulu. Mom wants to tell you something too.

24:28.535 --> 24:29.495
From now on,

24:30.535 --> 24:33.095
You don't have to do everything well

24:34.015 --> 24:35.535
or win the first place.

24:36.175 --> 24:36.935
You don't...

24:37.895 --> 24:41.695
have to be that sensible or
deliberate to please others.

24:42.255 --> 24:43.534
As long as you're happy,

24:43.535 --> 24:45.255
you could also win full marks in my heart.

24:45.975 --> 24:46.655
Really?

24:47.575 --> 24:49.434
Then I want to go shrimping on the riverside.

24:49.435 --> 24:50.015
No way.

24:52.615 --> 24:55.934
If I play at riversides,
you will still beat me up.

24:55.935 --> 24:56.415
Bingo.

25:05.975 --> 25:06.655
Hello.

25:08.095 --> 25:10.095
Yes. I'm at Erhai north road.

25:10.615 --> 25:11.175
I see.

25:13.375 --> 25:14.335
Take your bag. Let's go.

25:15.855 --> 25:16.535
And your bottle.

25:29.535 --> 25:30.015
You're here.

25:31.175 --> 25:31.855
Wait a while.

25:32.395 --> 25:33.455
They want to take some photos.

25:34.135 --> 25:34.695
Take photos?

25:36.375 --> 25:38.135
Yao said it's for publicity.

25:41.135 --> 25:42.535
Cangshan Mountain and Erhai Lake?

25:43.215 --> 25:45.375
Yes. It's the painting
of Cangshan Mountain and Erhai Lake.

25:46.095 --> 25:47.175
How long will it take?

25:48.415 --> 25:49.415
About several months.

25:50.255 --> 25:50.975
Look at me.

25:56.975 --> 25:57.775
What are you doing?

26:01.455 --> 26:02.895
Mr. Xie, I'm ready.

26:03.495 --> 26:04.535
- I see.
- Okay.

26:08.695 --> 26:10.575
Ms. Xie. What do you want to send me?

26:11.215 --> 26:12.215
Just a coat.

26:17.935 --> 26:18.975
Old-fashioned clothes.

26:19.615 --> 26:20.655
Not popular now.

26:21.815 --> 26:22.215
See.

26:24.975 --> 26:26.255
So beautiful.

26:28.855 --> 26:30.655
It was my mom's dowry.

26:31.655 --> 26:33.855
My granny embroidered it.

26:42.735 --> 26:43.895
It's so precious.

26:44.415 --> 26:45.695
Do you want to send it to me?

26:46.935 --> 26:48.855
It's planned for Yao's wife.

26:51.935 --> 26:54.134
What if we marry and then divorce?

26:54.135 --> 26:55.135
Is it still mine?

26:55.775 --> 26:57.615
For you, forever.

26:59.055 --> 26:59.855
So charming.

27:01.095 --> 27:02.414
I hate to wear it too.

27:02.415 --> 27:05.575
I want to leave it to my
daughter or my son's wife.

27:09.295 --> 27:09.935
Dear aunt.

27:10.495 --> 27:12.015
Are you going to send them to her?

27:13.375 --> 27:14.614
I can't keep it well.

27:14.615 --> 27:15.974
Insects may bite it.

27:15.975 --> 27:16.495
Xu Hongdou.

27:17.055 --> 27:20.134
If you accept it,
I'm afraid you have to marry me.

27:20.135 --> 27:21.414
I don't care.

27:21.415 --> 27:22.494
My present is mine.

27:22.495 --> 27:24.014
Ms. Xie has promised, right?

27:24.015 --> 27:25.655
Yes. She's right.

27:27.535 --> 27:28.814
You benefit from our relationship.

27:28.815 --> 27:32.255
These embroidery ornaments can't be bought now.

27:39.575 --> 27:40.934
Hi, everyone.

27:40.935 --> 27:43.254
I'm Singer Nana.

27:43.255 --> 27:44.815
I'm back to sing for you again.

27:45.655 --> 27:48.934
I haven't had live streaming for over a year.

27:48.935 --> 27:51.095
I thought to stop my career.

27:52.055 --> 27:55.214
I'm now in Yunnan,
working in a cafe.

27:55.215 --> 27:57.054
I have many good friends now.

27:57.055 --> 27:58.815
We all live in the same yard.

27:59.975 --> 28:02.774
Besides singing,
I want to tell you some stories

28:02.775 --> 28:05.134
between me and my friends.

28:05.135 --> 28:06.695
So interesting.

28:07.975 --> 28:09.374
Now, let's start.

28:09.375 --> 28:10.934
Old rules. Sing first.

28:10.935 --> 28:13.895
The song "I will stay here" is for you.

28:34.695 --> 28:35.655
What are you doing?

28:36.735 --> 28:37.175
Manjun.

28:38.415 --> 28:39.695
It's our league construction.

28:40.535 --> 28:41.734
League construction?

28:41.735 --> 28:43.055
Will you join us?

28:43.655 --> 28:44.655
Isn't it Nana?

28:48.455 --> 28:50.334
Why did you send a yacht?

28:50.335 --> 28:51.575
Why not give her the money?

28:52.415 --> 28:52.975
Xiaxia.

28:53.495 --> 28:54.894
Don't send expensive gifts.

28:54.895 --> 28:57.654
We just build a momentum
and warm the atmosphere.

28:57.655 --> 28:58.895
Don't need expensive gifts.

29:03.415 --> 29:06.014
Who is watching the live streaming?

29:06.015 --> 29:07.695
Why are they so rich?

29:08.215 --> 29:11.335
As she restarts today,
many people will send her gifts.

29:12.575 --> 29:13.935
Shall I do live stream too?

29:14.975 --> 29:15.974
You?

29:15.975 --> 29:17.055
Livestream blaming others?

29:19.455 --> 29:20.814
Hu Youyu! Why are you laughing?

29:20.815 --> 29:21.495
Did I blame you?

29:22.655 --> 29:23.215
See.

29:23.975 --> 29:26.735
Everyone here is laughing
but she only dares to blame me.

29:28.175 --> 29:29.254
You're the only pushover.

29:29.255 --> 29:30.214
Of course, it's you.

29:30.215 --> 29:30.895
Manjun.

29:32.375 --> 29:33.134
Oh, no, Manjun.

29:33.135 --> 29:34.295
How can you say so?

29:35.175 --> 29:36.054
Teach me later.

29:36.055 --> 29:37.334
I know nothing about it.

29:37.335 --> 29:37.855
Okay.

29:45.135 --> 29:45.935
More gifts.

29:56.375 --> 30:01.535
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

30:03.735 --> 30:08.175
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

30:09.135 --> 30:12.255
That's all for today's live streaming.

30:13.015 --> 30:16.655
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

30:17.555 --> 30:21.815
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

30:23.975 --> 30:26.274
Do you want to build

30:26.275 --> 30:29.095
a public-spirited persona by live-streaming?

30:34.295 --> 30:36.854
My present boss sent me a few words

30:36.855 --> 30:38.574
before today's live streaming.

30:38.575 --> 30:39.575
Let me read it for you.

30:47.295 --> 30:48.855
There will always be people who love you,

30:49.455 --> 30:50.375
hate you,

30:51.335 --> 30:52.535
support you

30:53.175 --> 30:54.335
and disdain you.

30:55.295 --> 30:56.415
Some hope you be well.

30:56.975 --> 30:58.055
Some want you to die.

30:58.975 --> 31:00.055
Some wish you to be free.

31:01.135 --> 31:03.295
Some try to control you.

31:04.975 --> 31:07.774
There are understandings
and misunderstandings

31:07.775 --> 31:08.855
in our lives.

31:10.055 --> 31:12.015
But everyone lives in this way.

31:12.875 --> 31:13.935
There's no exception.

31:16.215 --> 31:18.975
So... Whatever.

31:19.615 --> 31:21.615
My dear friends, see you tomorrow.

31:24.255 --> 31:30.895
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

31:41.375 --> 31:42.454
It's her!

31:42.455 --> 31:43.814
Yao's girlfriend!

31:43.815 --> 31:45.135
From Beijing.

31:54.135 --> 31:54.615
Ms. Xu.

31:55.975 --> 31:56.575
Ye Sen.

31:57.535 --> 31:59.354
Mr. Xie said you're unloading
ceramic tiles here.

31:59.355 --> 32:02.015
He's busy so he asked me to come to help you.

32:02.735 --> 32:04.554
Why is he busy?

32:04.555 --> 32:06.534
His former colleague introduced him an investor.

32:06.535 --> 32:07.855
They've gone to Village Committee.

32:09.815 --> 32:11.134
What investor?

32:11.135 --> 32:12.135
I've never heard about it before.

32:12.695 --> 32:14.695
Experts in tourism development.

32:15.975 --> 32:17.534
He said to play in Dali.

32:17.535 --> 32:19.214
Drove here himself.

32:19.215 --> 32:21.014
I think he's like Mr. Liu.

32:21.015 --> 32:21.815
No reception.

32:24.895 --> 32:26.015
Park it there. Have some tea.

32:27.115 --> 32:27.815
Almost finished.

32:28.375 --> 32:29.175
Hold on a second.

32:32.815 --> 32:35.134
It's a historical wall.

32:35.135 --> 32:36.774
We won't demolish it but maintain it.

32:36.775 --> 32:38.214
It has a sense of time.

32:38.215 --> 32:41.095
We provide protective maintenance
for many old houses.

32:41.975 --> 32:43.535
Where will the bookstore be?

32:44.215 --> 32:46.575
An old house in the village depth.

32:47.815 --> 32:48.895
- This way, please.
- Fine.

32:52.375 --> 32:53.255
Have a seat.

33:06.215 --> 33:07.774
Everyone is here.

33:07.775 --> 33:08.774
Gui comes back.

33:08.775 --> 33:09.334
Gui.

33:09.335 --> 33:10.454
Hello!

33:10.455 --> 33:11.574
You're back.

33:11.575 --> 33:12.254
Yes.

33:12.255 --> 33:13.734
When did you come back?

33:13.735 --> 33:15.095
Just now.

33:16.335 --> 33:19.974
Qingdao has a lot of seafood.

33:19.975 --> 33:21.255
So palatable!

33:27.815 --> 33:28.335
Feng.

33:29.135 --> 33:31.775
I bring you some dried squid and fish.

33:34.015 --> 33:35.494
I won't delay you.

33:35.495 --> 33:37.055
I'll leave soon.

33:39.455 --> 33:40.494
How's your journey there?

33:40.495 --> 33:41.055
Happy or not?

33:43.335 --> 33:44.575
So happy!

33:45.175 --> 33:47.935
Oh, my disgusting Zeqing.

33:48.835 --> 33:50.574
He says he doesn't like living in a building.

33:50.575 --> 33:52.614
Their house isn't small.

33:52.615 --> 33:54.414
But he tells me it's like a matchbox.

33:54.415 --> 33:55.615
Too small.

33:57.295 --> 33:59.894
As he has few friends outside,

33:59.895 --> 34:02.134
it's a quite tough time for him.

34:02.135 --> 34:03.974
Obviously, he can't adjust it.

34:03.975 --> 34:07.335
It's called "wild boar can't enjoy chaff".

34:07.975 --> 34:09.174
Can you adjust?

34:09.175 --> 34:10.015
Of course!

34:10.775 --> 34:12.215
I was so happy there!

34:13.975 --> 34:16.454
I've known clearly about

34:16.455 --> 34:19.055
markets and supermarkets near the block.

34:20.055 --> 34:23.855
Every old lady in the block knows me.

34:24.495 --> 34:27.414
And I've already known
how many kids they have,

34:27.415 --> 34:30.254
kids' jobs and salaries,
whose children are sensible

34:30.255 --> 34:31.974
and whose are unfilial.

34:31.975 --> 34:33.415
I've known them well!

34:34.375 --> 34:37.694
Auntie Gui should do intelligence work.

34:37.695 --> 34:39.055
She's just inquisitive.

34:40.095 --> 34:41.334
I'll go to find you this evening.

34:41.335 --> 34:42.414
Is Qiang at home?

34:42.415 --> 34:42.975
Yes.

34:43.495 --> 34:45.014
So assiduous.

34:45.015 --> 34:50.334
He tidies up the whole house,
yard and also the fields.

34:50.335 --> 34:52.135
He even learns to cook.

34:53.055 --> 34:54.654
See! What did I tell you?

34:54.655 --> 34:56.815
As I just came in,
I found you energetic-looking.

34:57.335 --> 34:59.334
Joy puts heart into you!

34:59.335 --> 35:00.334
Right?

35:00.335 --> 35:01.814
Come on, Auntie Gui.

35:01.815 --> 35:02.654
But excuse me.

35:02.655 --> 35:03.935
We're working now.

35:04.815 --> 35:06.055
Drive me away again?

35:06.775 --> 35:07.854
I see.

35:07.855 --> 35:08.974
I'm leaving.

35:08.975 --> 35:10.454
I need to visit Baoping.

35:10.455 --> 35:11.534
I'll leave you to work.

35:11.535 --> 35:12.734
- Take care.
- Take care!

35:12.735 --> 35:15.134
Qingdao's seafood is so tasty!

35:15.135 --> 35:16.014
Auntie, take care!

35:16.015 --> 35:16.774
Fine! Bye!

35:16.775 --> 35:17.975
Take care!

35:20.115 --> 35:20.994
Here is it.

35:20.995 --> 35:22.415
Fried taro with seaweed.

35:23.215 --> 35:23.615
Thank you.

35:24.255 --> 35:24.775
Auntie Hua.

35:25.615 --> 35:27.374
Yao, I've just mentioned you.

35:27.375 --> 35:29.254
Luckily, you didn't come at lunchtime.

35:29.255 --> 35:30.574
Otherwise, there's no space to sit.

35:30.575 --> 35:31.894
Is your business so good?

35:31.895 --> 35:32.615
Congratulations.

35:33.175 --> 35:35.855
Many people come to eat here from the town.

35:37.255 --> 35:38.735
But we decided to have a respite.

35:40.135 --> 35:43.094
Xiangdong's arm has the anesthesia needle

35:43.095 --> 35:44.854
and his legs have varicosity.

35:44.855 --> 35:46.374
The doctor asked him to rest.

35:46.375 --> 35:48.534
But we've discussed it with Honghong.

35:48.535 --> 35:50.374
They'll come back next month

35:50.375 --> 35:52.094
to help us operate the restaurant.

35:52.095 --> 35:53.894
Will they come back?

35:53.895 --> 35:54.735
So great!

35:56.415 --> 35:57.734
Take your time.

35:57.735 --> 35:58.974
Call me if you need.

35:58.975 --> 35:59.374
Okay.

35:59.375 --> 35:59.735
Thank you!

36:02.335 --> 36:02.935
Finished?

36:04.455 --> 36:06.975
Fortunately, Ye Sen was there.

36:07.495 --> 36:09.254
He checked every box.

36:09.255 --> 36:11.134
Three are installed incorrectly.

36:11.135 --> 36:12.215
We sent them back at once.

36:13.495 --> 36:16.175
I've helped you furnish
the yard so I'm experienced.

36:18.295 --> 36:19.615
What about your investor?

36:23.095 --> 36:24.094
No progress.

36:24.095 --> 36:25.374
He's here to look around.

36:25.375 --> 36:28.094
The village needs to get the leaders' opinions.

36:28.095 --> 36:29.575
It involves the development policy.

36:31.495 --> 36:32.295
It will be fine.

36:33.195 --> 36:34.695
My investment sight is not bad, right?

36:36.255 --> 36:36.935
So nice.

36:37.775 --> 36:40.614
I admire your sight the most.

36:40.615 --> 36:42.295
You're the master of high-risk investment.

36:43.855 --> 36:45.615
Is running a guesthouse high-risk?

36:46.295 --> 36:48.654
Haven't you invested the rest life in Mr. Xie?

36:48.655 --> 36:51.894
If the guesthouse runs well,

36:51.895 --> 36:53.735
I'll open up a branch elsewhere.

36:54.335 --> 36:55.735
I can make money myself.

36:56.255 --> 36:57.495
So if he's not kind to me,

36:58.055 --> 36:58.855
I'll abandon him.

37:00.575 --> 37:01.935
Ye Sen is just a pot-stirrer.

37:48.255 --> 37:49.135
Dear lady.

37:50.575 --> 37:53.535
Would you please play a song with me?

37:55.055 --> 37:55.735
Okay.

38:06.215 --> 38:07.895
♫ I always aspire ♫

38:08.815 --> 38:10.415
♫ to complete my dream. ♫

38:11.975 --> 38:13.455
♫ The more eager I am, ♫

38:14.415 --> 38:16.575
♫ the clumsier I look. ♫

38:17.495 --> 38:19.375
♫ Your messy look ♫

38:20.095 --> 38:21.775
♫ and my trepidation ♫

38:23.735 --> 38:26.055
♫ are noticed by it. ♫

38:29.495 --> 38:31.415
♫ It still keeps it secret. ♫

38:32.495 --> 38:33.894
♫ Someone stops ♫

38:33.895 --> 38:36.895
♫ and someone still ♫

38:38.615 --> 38:39.775
♫ goes on the tramp. ♫

38:41.055 --> 38:42.935
♫ Life is a window ♫

38:43.815 --> 38:45.575
♫ and time is the house. ♫

38:46.535 --> 38:48.854
♫ Stories make the afar ♫

38:48.855 --> 38:51.455
♫ further and deeper. ♫

38:52.055 --> 38:59.375
♫ Blow away our sadness. ♫

39:00.655 --> 39:02.535
♫ The vast expanse of the heart ♫

39:03.495 --> 39:05.295
♫ brings more light. ♫

39:06.335 --> 39:08.094
♫ Stories we want ♫

39:08.095 --> 39:11.575
♫ just happen to the windows ♫

39:12.095 --> 39:14.015
♫ beside us. ♫

39:20.975 --> 39:22.235
♫ People... ♫

39:33.541 --> 39:38.135
♫ are forgetful. ♫

39:41.735 --> 39:43.415
Here you are, fat dog.

39:45.855 --> 39:47.454
Damai's dog comes out.

39:47.455 --> 39:48.255
Where's she?

40:00.735 --> 40:03.455
Damai is quite like...

40:04.695 --> 40:05.455
that.

40:06.695 --> 40:07.455
What?

40:09.515 --> 40:10.255
You know it.

40:12.895 --> 40:13.535
Yeah.

40:37.815 --> 40:38.735
Latte, please.

40:43.455 --> 40:44.615
What's wrong with your head?

40:45.295 --> 40:47.374
I was shooting the video "master hits me again".

40:47.375 --> 40:48.175
My master made it.

40:49.615 --> 40:51.255
Nana, can I take a photo with you?

40:51.975 --> 40:52.655
Yes.

41:01.215 --> 41:02.974
He's good at photography.

41:02.975 --> 41:04.615
He excelled himself today.

41:05.415 --> 41:06.654
Nana, I love you so much.

41:06.655 --> 41:08.174
I like listening to your singing.

41:08.175 --> 41:08.814
Thank you.

41:08.815 --> 41:10.294
I always watched your live streaming.

41:10.295 --> 41:11.175
Thank you so much.

41:12.655 --> 41:14.574
Nana is now a superstar.

41:14.575 --> 41:16.895
People come to take photos with her every day.

41:25.615 --> 41:26.375
Hello.

41:28.175 --> 41:30.535
Yes. We have a clerk called Nana.

41:32.055 --> 41:33.174
You can come to abuse her.

41:33.175 --> 41:34.975
The address is Yunnan province...

41:37.775 --> 41:38.655
Coward.

41:39.895 --> 41:41.374
Do they still make calls?

41:41.375 --> 41:42.814
The calls have decreased.

41:42.815 --> 41:45.295
As long as they call,
I'll invite them here.

41:50.015 --> 41:51.015
For coffee?

41:52.195 --> 41:53.654
What's wrong with your forehead?

41:53.655 --> 41:54.334
I was shooting...

41:54.335 --> 41:56.414
The exclusive actor to suffer beating

41:56.415 --> 41:57.534
of "master hits me again".

41:57.535 --> 41:58.175
Understand?

42:04.375 --> 42:05.015
Brother-in-law.

42:06.655 --> 42:07.375
Luo Quan.

42:12.735 --> 42:13.775
Don't abuse him.

42:16.615 --> 42:18.455
I've told you.

42:19.055 --> 42:21.174
If you can persuade him,
then do it.

42:21.175 --> 42:22.974
If you can't, it doesn't matter.

42:22.975 --> 42:25.855
But I won't compromise on Hulu's matter.

42:27.295 --> 42:27.895
I...

42:29.055 --> 42:32.295
You're the tardiest man I've seen.

42:32.935 --> 42:34.934
You've already over 30.

42:34.935 --> 42:37.174
How can you still listen to your dad?

42:37.175 --> 42:39.294
Your dad is just over 50.

42:39.295 --> 42:43.655
He's already treated those
health products sellers as his relatives.

42:44.615 --> 42:46.774
You have to support your family.

42:46.775 --> 42:48.854
You need to have your own idea!

42:48.855 --> 42:49.654
I know.

42:49.655 --> 42:51.094
What do you know?

42:51.095 --> 42:52.174
Let me say something.

42:52.175 --> 42:53.455
Fine. Go ahead.

42:55.895 --> 42:56.855
My dad agreed.

42:58.775 --> 43:01.255
He agreed with your idea.

43:11.375 --> 43:12.415
Why so abrupt?

43:18.015 --> 43:21.255
I've told him you wouldn't remarry me.

43:22.535 --> 43:23.254
Then he agreed.

43:23.255 --> 43:24.374
Wouldn't?

43:24.375 --> 43:25.694
Of course, I won't.

43:25.695 --> 43:27.135
Does it matter to me?

43:28.695 --> 43:31.175
You haven't remarried for years

43:31.935 --> 43:34.814
so I think maybe there's a chance.

43:34.815 --> 43:35.774
Wait!

43:35.775 --> 43:36.815
Let me sort it out.

43:37.695 --> 43:38.775
You want to remarry me?

43:40.175 --> 43:41.215
When?

43:41.775 --> 43:43.774
Why don't I know it?

43:43.775 --> 43:44.895
It's been a long time.

43:46.215 --> 43:47.455
I'm thinking about it all the time.

43:49.775 --> 43:51.654
It's been three years since we divorced.

43:51.655 --> 43:53.174
The reason why I haven't remarried

43:53.175 --> 43:54.934
is that I haven't met the right person.

43:54.935 --> 43:56.414
None of your business.

43:56.415 --> 43:59.015
When I was with you,
I thought it was like...

44:03.615 --> 44:04.754
Of course.

44:04.755 --> 44:06.015
It's also because I was young.

44:06.575 --> 44:07.575
But I won't jump into

44:09.095 --> 44:10.255
the same pit once again.

44:10.895 --> 44:11.615
Understand?

44:14.735 --> 44:15.335
Yes.

44:16.455 --> 44:17.135
Okay, fine.

44:19.095 --> 44:19.935
It's getting dark.

44:21.175 --> 44:22.534
You can't go back now.

44:22.535 --> 44:23.494
Go to my home first.

44:23.495 --> 44:24.495
Let's talk later.

44:25.095 --> 44:26.015
I need to work now.

44:32.215 --> 44:33.255
What are you looking at?

44:40.255 --> 44:45.455
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

44:47.695 --> 44:52.375
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

44:55.095 --> 45:00.895
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

45:01.495 --> 45:06.575
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

45:09.815 --> 45:14.935
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:17.175 --> 45:21.775
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:24.615 --> 45:30.535
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:31.135 --> 45:37.055
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:39.415 --> 45:45.854
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:45.855 --> 45:52.335
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:54.015 --> 45:56.054
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:56.055 --> 46:00.175
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:00.695 --> 46:07.615
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:12.695 --> 46:17.575
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

46:20.015 --> 46:25.095
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

46:27.415 --> 46:33.814
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

46:33.815 --> 46:40.455
